		(property "Description" "Bel Fuse 2250504-1 (=Bel int. P/N 0826-1X1T-KH-F), 1x1 2.5GBASE-T 100W 4PPoE single-port MagJack ICM, THT tab-up, W/O LEDS. 16-pin + 4 shield legs (merged to 1 SH pin here) per Bel/TRP drawing C=2250504 Rev1 17APR2017. Fix pass 2026-07-15: TRD1+/TRD1- pin assignment corrected to the drawing (TRD1+ = 11, TRD1- = 10; Task 10 had them swapped); all four pairs re-verified. Bob-Smith termination is INTERNAL to this ICM (drawing page 2: R1-R4 75 ohms + C2-C5 22nF/100V + C1 1000pF/2KV to SHIELD) -- do NOT duplicate externally. VC12/36/45/78 = PoE center taps, cable side. NOTE: authoritative drawing shows NO LED pins for this exact P/N despite Bel's product-page metadata claiming LED:Yes." (at 0 0 0) (hide yes) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27))))
