		(property "Description" "TI TLV62569 2A synchronous step-down converter, 2.5-5.5V in, 1.5MHz, DCS-Control (seamless PSM at light load), internal soft start 900us, SOT-23-5. Fix-1 branch-B replacement for the Task-10 AP2112K-1.0 LDO scope-addition: real >=1A sync buck for the RTL8125BG-CG external 0.95V core rail (BGS variant with internal SWR not orderable -- no LCSC/authorized-distributor listing, live-checked 2026-07-15). EN driven by RTL8125 POW_EXT_SWR pin 6 exactly as Realtek reference V122 page 4 'Power Module for External Core Power' sanctions; FB divider 59k/100k -> 0.954V (the same ratio the reference's own table gives for the RTL8125B-series 0.95V core). Sourced: LCSC C141836 (106,900 stock, $0.088@1, live-checked 2026-07-15)." (at 0 0 0) (hide yes) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27))))
		(property "ki_keywords" "buck converter step-down 0.95V core" (at 0 0 0) (hide yes) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27))))
